window.products.push({"id":1034084,"name":"Anicell Vacuum Belt for Bissell Style 7/9/10 P/N3031120 Belt, 6pcs Replacement Belt for Bissell Powerlifter Swivel pet /Powerforce Helix/ Cleanview Cl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61COtM52DXL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Broad Adaptation】Our belts are compatible with Bissell CleanView Swivel, PowerForce Helix, Rewind Pet, Smartclean, PowerGroom, Pet HairEraser, PowerTrak, Powerlifter, PowerForce, PowerGlide, PowerEase, Total Floors, PowerClean, Velocity models. Compatible with Bissell CleanView Swivel Upright Rewind Pet 2252 2489 22543 2254 2486 24899 2260 1793 vacuum cleaner. Belts for Bissell Style 7/9/10 p/n 3031120 belts are compatible with Bissell styles 7/9/10/12/14/16 vacuum cleaners. 【Premium Quality】Made of high quality rubber, our belts for bissell 3031120 are durable and flexible with good ductility. When vacuuming, vacuum belt receives a large pressure traction and is not easy to deform or break. Our product includes 6 pieces, which solves your troubles that you need to replace parts regularly. Basically buy once, no need to buy again within 1-2 years. 【Easy to Assemble】Using a screw driver remove the screws and lift off the brush plate. Remove the roller and the old belt. (Note: Unplugged before replacing the belt.) Attach the newbelt 3031120 for bissell vacuum belt to the motor pulley and the roller. With belt in place, push and slide roller into the unit, making sure that the roller are in the correct place. Reposition the brush plate and screw in the screws. 【Kind tips】Make sure your brush roll is free of debris and spins freely so you have no problems with your for bissell vacuum belt 7/9/10. Your new vacuum belt will be smaller in size because your old one is stretched out. When comparing, it is common for the new belt to be 1-3\" shorter in length than the old, stretched and worn belt. You should have to stretch the belt fairly hard put the brushroll in place, it is this tension that causes the brushroll to turn. 【Replacement Belts】Because the vacuum cleaner is often used, style 7/9/10 p/n3031120 belt for bissell is easy to wear. It is recommended to check whether the vacuum belt 3031120 is worn out in 3-6 months, and it will not affect normal use. If it is worn out, please replace the belt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61COtM52DXL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anicell","source_asin":"B0B31JCVQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B31JCVQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B31JCVQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
