window.products.push({"id":1034208,"name":"Bascuda® Ceramic Coasters Set of 4 Drinks Coasters for Cups Mugs Glass - Moroccan Decorations Ceramic Pottery Tile Coasters Home Living Kitchen Coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PJlqMpLTS._AC_SL1470_.jpg","description":"AMAZING DESIGN We have chosen the most beautiful and widely popular patterns of traditional Turkish and Moroccan (Marrakech) tile patterns for our coasters. The vivid colours and timeless patterns of these ornaments (decorations) would bring liveliness to your living room, office or writing table accessories or near your table place mats. SPECIFICATIONS Material of the upper layer: Ceramic Material of the back side: Natural EVA Sponge (It is perfect for outdoor due to resistant composition) Shape: Round Diameter: 9 cm Package includes: 4 x Premium Ceramic Coasters ANTI-SCRATCH AND SLIP RESISTANT BACK EVA sponge is a high quality and widely used material, which is known for its shock resistant, slip resistant and anti-scratch characteristics. This is the exact material that we used on back of our cup coasters. Thus, our coasters prevent the surface that they are put on from being scratched. They also keep your glass/cup/mug stable thanks to its slip resistant characteristic. EASY TO CLEAN Our mandala coasters are stain resistant and easy to clean. In case a drink spills over on to the coaster, you only need to rinse it under water. HEAT RESISTANT The ceramic design of the coaster set has high level of heat resistance. Our mug mat easily tolerates hot drinks and also prevents the heat of the drink to damage the furniture, on which our coaster is placed on. The ceramic stone make them absorbent. Use them for your coffee drink as a coffee mat, for your summer drinks as a drink mat. FRIENDLY REMINDER Coasters are not suitable for machine wash. Rinsing under water would be enough to clean them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PJlqMpLTS._AC_SL1470_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bascuda","source_asin":"B086JNM775","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086JNM775","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086JNM775","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
