window.products.push({"id":1034271,"name":"Yodeace 2ft Small Christmas Tree, Mini Christmas Tree with Christmas Tree Skirt and 30pcs Christmas Tree Ornaments for Christmas Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tKFj5LoiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Get: 24 inch Christmas tree, 1pcs Christmas Tree skirt, 13ft 30LED string light, 6.56ft gold glitter garland, 1pcs star, 1pcs MERRY CHRISTMAS, 3pcs Christmas ball, 2pcs mini drum, 2pcs bell, 3pcs Santa Claus, 2pcs present box, 6pcs bowknot, 10pcs greeting card 24 Inch Christmas Tree: The Christmas pine tree is an ideal way to brighten up a variety of places around your house during the festive season, with the addition of a few decorations you can create a really festive feel to your home No Mess: The Christmas tree is made of safe and non-toxic PVC, comes with a Christmas tree skirt, you can avoid the pitfalls of a real tree with no fallen pine needles, sap, or water on your carpet. A great decoration for living room, office and any other indoor/outdoor place Easy To Set Up: With about 50 individually crafted branch tips. You need to take some time (about 10 minutes) for all the furry branches to come out, just twist and bend to fill the gaps. Children can join into the assembly of the tree which is a great Christmas family activity Light up Christmas: This charming tabletop tree is full with festive atmosphere, you could put this in your kitchen, dinning table or office desk to make it light the Christmas. You also can pack it into a compact size when not in use, convenient to store for next year's use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tKFj5LoiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yodeace","source_asin":"B08NJQFHKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NJQFHKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NJQFHKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1034272,"name":"Alhamra Handmade Ceramic Decorative Pomegranates, Home Decor Vases Set of 3 (Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rFMgqat+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Turkey has one of the oldest practices of stoneware production in the world reaching back thousands of years ago, from the primitive sculptures of prehistoric Anatolia to the earthenware pots of the Hittites and finally the ornamented hand-painted tiles of Iznik.  Ottoman pottery lived its peak ages during the 16th century in which Iznik glazed tiles evolved and set its own traditional unique motifs and methods. With that Ottoman heritage, Turkey has evolved some of the most sophisticated technologies and innovative products on the market.  Each pomegranete has been hand- crafted by these talented Turkish artisans so there might be some slight pattern differences and imperfections on the surface. Marks of ‘glaze pops’ can sometimes occur on hand made porcelain products. They are considered normal and will not affect the quality.  To sense the ancestral feeling in your home, order now our conventional bowls!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rFMgqat+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alhamra Ceramics","source_asin":"B079RJXDX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079RJXDX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079RJXDX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
