window.products.push({"id":1034320,"name":"TIBORANG Nonstick 8 in 1 Multipurpose Woks and Stir Fry Pans,12.6 Inch 6L Heat Indicator Die-cast Aluminum Titanium Coating 100% PFOA Free Wok Pan wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hq5SXyi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳5 NEW Innovative Breakthrough:1.NEW air press release button with 10 KPA micro pressure valve on the lid can save 50% of your cooking time.2.NEW engraved special message on the titanium pot body \"My Heart will go on\", state of art workmanship.3.NEW build in bakelite ears to prevent heat, no additional scalding tools are needed to lift the pot body.4.NEW available in 6 new fashion colours.5.The wok pan support long-term dry cooking 10 minutes. 🍳Exclusive Design Multifunctional Wok Pan: The nonstick wok set is perfect for deep-frying, pressure cooking, steaming, boiling, decocting, grilling, stir frying and Hotpot. You can even use it to steam vegetables. It's a great way to make cooking more fun and inventive. 🍳Sturdy Wok Body:The hard anodized aluminum is harder than stainless steel and is dense, making it corrosion and scratch resistant, plus it won’t react to acidic foods,Compared with cast iron pans and stainless steel pans, it is light in weight, so Oven safe up to 420°F/216°C, Dishwasher safe. 🍳Non-Stick Coating & Healthy Material:The nonstick frying pan is made of 7 layers of materials. The surface hard titanium coating reinforced, scratch resistant and toxin free nonstick interior stands up to everyday use. and it's very easy to wash. 100% Free of PFAS, PFOA, APEO, lead or cadmium.no need to worry about toxic substances and coatings falling off. 🍳Preheat Function: The front end of the stir fry pan handle has a temperature indicator. The indicator is red before heading, and red changes to white after heating, note that when oil temperature is ≥150℃, it will automatically change to white. Just by observing the color of the indicator, you can know exactly know when the food is ready to be served.Unlike woks & stir-fry pans, the skillet allows you to cook with less oil or butter and the pots and pans is suitable for 3-8 people. 🍳Vertical Silicone Glass Lid: The lid is surrounded by rubber gasket to preserve heat and prevent lid glass to be shatter. It helps seals in the flavor of the food and preserve nutrients for a healthier and better tasting food. The transparent glass lid helps determine when your food is ready. If you want to clean rubber rip gaskets surrounding the lid, you can sprinkle baking soda and brush it thoroughly, oily smell will go away in no time. 🍳Detachable Bakelite Handle & Easy Storage: The flat wok bottom and handle adopts with invisible screw, which makes it easy to wash and disassemble after each use, no tool is required and no rust over time. Bakelite handles stay cool on the stovetop for maximum comfort. 🍳Package & Size: Wok set: 1.1 x Wok Pan, 1 x Gift Box, 1 x Pot Lid, 1 x Silicone Spatula, 1 x 13” non-stick wok steamer grid, 1 x Non-stick silicone pad.2.Please note that the build in bakelite ears do not need to take out during cooking or baking, it can take up to 300℃ of heat during cooking.3.1 x Installation instruction menu, Size: 12.6\" x 8.3\" x 4.1\" 💡Tips: When you turn off the stove after cooking, please open the lid or press the micro pressure valve button (New Feature) to avoid the excessive pressure in the pot. For safety reasons, after turning off your stove, the maximum duration coving the lid is 30 minutes without releasing the air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hq5SXyi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIBORANG","source_asin":"B09TKWY2V1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKWY2V1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKWY2V1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
