window.products.push({"id":1034521,"name":"Classical Creations North American P-51D Mustang Aircraft 12\" Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fJrVYs2jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a wall clock featuring the North American P-51D Mustang, one of the iconic aircraft of WWII. The top half of the clock face depicts a color illustration of the aircraft, and the bottom half lists statistics such as engine specifications, performance, armament, etc. It is approximately 12\" in diameter. This would make a great gift or personal item for the military aviation buff. About Our 12\" Wall Clocks Attractive and functional, our 12\" wall clocks feature beautiful photo-quality artwork and reliable USA-made clock motors. The 1/4\" thick wood base is a premium Certified Green Product that is durable and environmentally friendly. The classic look and quiet operation of our clocks make them perfect for just about any room in your home or office. We are sure you will be proud to give them as gifts or treasure them yourself for years to come. Our Classic Artwork Most traditional artwork is rectangular, which leads to the question: \"How do you fit a square piece of artwork on a round clock?\" Most \"fine art\" clocks are made by either cropping a circle in the center of the artwork discarding much of the original image, or shrinking the image down and adding plain borders to fill the extra space. We chose to do something different. Our graphic artists start with a high-resolution copy of the original image, and use state-of-the-art software to digitally \"mold\" the rectangular artwork on the face of a circular clock. Each image is meticulously edited, and care is taken to preserve the integrity of the original artwork while minimizing the distortion inherent in this type of image manipulation. We think you will agree that our clocks are more attractive and capture the look of the original artwork better than other similar offerings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fJrVYs2jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classical Creations","source_asin":"B00I6SI4BK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I6SI4BK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I6SI4BK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
