window.products.push({"id":1034525,"name":"Norbi Window Door Room Divider Line String Curtain Tassel Scarf Valance (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517FYBVhZGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Norbi Vogue Tassel String 78.74 inch x 39.37 inch Door Window String Curtain Cute Panel Room Divider for Wedding Coffee House Home Decoration Application: It can be used for door, window, wall, party, wedding, living room, dining room, office, or any other space. Style: Rainbow Tassel Curtain; Vogue Tassel Curtain Feature: Width:39.37 inch ,Length: 78.74 inch 78inch Meterial: Low-elastic yarn Package includes: 1 pc Warm Tips: 1.Please allow 3-5cm error due to manual measurement. pls make sure you do not mind before you bid. 2.Due to different screen display, the color and sparsity of the actual item may vary slightly from the above images. 3.If you want looks more concentrated, pls order 2 pcs or more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517FYBVhZGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Norbi","source_asin":"B07H15HCGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H15HCGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H15HCGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1034526,"name":"SLIFEOW Curtain Tiebacks Ropes, Decorative Handmade Tie Backs Curtain Holdbacks with 2 Metal Screw Hooks, Holders Cord for Thin or Thick Window Drapes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M9LF5432L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Curtain ties are long in size and are used to secure large and thick curtains, whether blackout cloth or thin curtains, with a rope diameter of 0.43 inches and a total length of between 29.5-30.2 inches. (Hand-woven, length may vary depending on color) The package comes with a pair of curtain ties and 2 metal screw hooks + 2 expansion bolts. There are two installation methods. Method 1. If it is a board, you can directly rotate the hook with your hand and drill into the board. Method 2: If it is a wall, you can use a drill bit to drill a suitable hole in the wall, and then use a hammer to drive the expansion screw into the hole, and then hook it into the expansion screw hole to complete the installation. The curtain tie back is a hand-woven from high-density 2-strand bold polyester rope, which is tighter and stronger than other ropes. They are not easy to loosen, smooth to the touch, no pilling, no peculiar smell. The end of the rope is fixed with a solid rope, which is more aesthetically pleasing and firm than other ropes and does not loosen or fall apart. The rings of the hooks on both sides do not extend and break. You can tie it directly to the curtain or use it with a hook. These curtain tiebacks can secure your curtains in seconds and no more worrying about slipping. The outer layer of the included metal screw hook is also coated with rubber, which can effectively prevent rust and protect your curtain from friction damage. The design is simple to meet any style of curtains, with a lanyard design, and the lacing can match curtains of any color or pattern. It can be used not only indoors (perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, balconies, and offices) but also outdoors (such as porches, pergolas, and gazebo curtains)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M9LF5432L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLIFEOW","source_asin":"B0BTVSJGFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTVSJGFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTVSJGFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
