window.products.push({"id":1034529,"name":"Blue Boat, a Nicely Painted Wooden Rowboat, 15 X 19 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H5AFDR-HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Giclée prints from ARThouse are printed on either an acid-free fine art paper (Epson or Somerset Velvet) or a natural medium weight canvas, using light-fast archival inks (Epson K3) on a professional digital printer. Each print is signed and titled personally by the artist. You will receive exactly the image you see here. A biography of the artist and certificate of authenticity are included with each print. Your print will come in a clear acetate envelope, rolled carefully in a mailing tube (it will flatten out easily).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H5AFDR-HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mimi Hegler","source_asin":"B00HZVZBCE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HZVZBCE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HZVZBCE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1034530,"name":"Elite Gourmet Vintage Diner 50’s Retro 12\" Pizza, Bake Countertop Toaster Oven, 6 slice, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qtLkz5DQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Retro is in! This Americana Collection toaster oven is ideal for any home. The beautiful range of colors will provide some vibrant colors in your home. No need to heat up your house with your large oven. This toaster oven overall dimensions are 19\" x 16\" x 12.5\" with an inner capacity size of 13\" x 13\" x 9.5\". It can fit 6 slices of bread or a whole 12\" pizza with ease. The timer and temperature are both adjustable providing the right toasty-ness. Accessories include a bake tray, wire rack and crumb tray.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qtLkz5DQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elite Gourmet","source_asin":"B01LYLAXDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYLAXDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYLAXDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1034531,"name":"Personalized Whiskey Making Kit (061) - Create Your Own Single Malt Whiskey - The Outlaw Kit from Skeeter's Reserve Outlaw Gear - MADE BY American Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bg2JfaxTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Sturdy Handcrafted Construction Combined elements of oak, fire and steel, American Oak Barrel creates the finest oak barrels in our industry. Handcrafted American white oak staves cut & fitted precisely around two equal heads of oak and perfectly bound by 6 hoops of steel! In-house Staff Our trained staff working the phones, processing orders, creating and setting the engraved designs to ensure a positive experience. Customer Service Our team of knowledgeable individuals are ready to service any barrel needs you may have. Whether its help with curing your barrel or replacing a leaky spigot, they will get you up to speed in no time. It's one of the perks of becoming a member of our Outlaw Family. Inhouse Art Design We have an extensive library of custom created designs to utilize for any occasion. Our custom engraved barrels are frequently gifted and nothing comes close to a personalized oak barrel MADE BY American Oak Barrel. Place it in a room and pour yourself a few lasting memories right from the tap! Custom Laser Engraved Personalization Our engravers offer state of art technology, calibrated precisely to ensure constant power and speed delivery to the barrel head surface. Please note that no ink is used in the engraving process. Any fluctuations in the finished burn is solely \"Nature's\" doing as combinations of hard and soft grains can yield some contrasting results. This is part of the beauty that makes it truly unique and guaranteed to be a \"one of a kind\" treasure. Fastest Turnover Times Keeping everything in-house gives American Oak Barrel the necessary control needed to meet the tightest turnover demands. Order Processing, Art Design, Proof Reading, Engraving, Packing & Shipping all executed seamlessly under one roof! That's how most custom orders are completed and shipped same day! That's really good news when you need a great gift fast.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bg2JfaxTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Oak Barrel","source_asin":"B07JKT2LPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JKT2LPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JKT2LPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
