window.products.push({"id":1034709,"name":"Handmade Hanging Wall Basket Decor - (Set of 3) - Round Woven Basket Wall Decor - Natural Boho Home Decor - Decorative Seagrass Bowl and Trays - Flat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YOZXA03aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These rustic and boho baskets are handmade in Vietnam from natural seagrass. The airiness of these wicker baskets will give you the feeling of being in your own beach house or the bohemian vibes of a tropical and trendy destination like Bali or Tulum. They also make beautiful and unique room decor for your rustic farmhouse walls. Each piece has a hook on the back to allow for easy, lightweight, and effortless hanging, should you chose to display them on a wall. Use these baskets for a variety of purposes such as table decor, wall decorations for living room, kitchen decor, bedroom decor, to hold fruits and vegetables, or as a chic coffee table decorative tray. They will look great on your home wall hung as a woven wall basket set or you can add to an array of other wall hangings, baskets, and or woven items. As these baskets are made of all natural seagrass, color may slightly vary. Please note, young seagrass is naturally green and turns a beautiful golden tan as it matures. We do our best to harvest the most mature seagrass, but in some circumstances you may receive a basket with a greenish tint. The color will tan over time but can be accelerated if left out in the sun. However, if you are unsatisfied with your purchase, please exchange your set. Each basket is uniquely handcrafted with professional care from sustainable all natural recycled materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YOZXA03aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Flower Bungalow","source_asin":"B08KV9L335","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KV9L335","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KV9L335","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
