window.products.push({"id":1034851,"name":"Enchante Home - Anton Turkish Towels - 16 Piece Towel Set, Long Staple Turkish Towel - Quick Dry, Soft, Absorbent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dlhtxTJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Try our extra soft, absorbent and fluffy product if you would like to improve your bathing experiences. Redecorate your space with our plush, luxurious and eye-catching towel set for a stylish appeal. The clean lines and a silky, smooth feel provides you an excellent comfort plus coziness for everyday use. Wrap up in the luxurious Turkish towels, loomed from premium long-staple Turkish cotton. The generous size is a luxury. Bring a sense of style to the bath, extra soft and plush, it gets loftier and more divine with each wash. This Turkish towel is just the perfect weight and absorbency. ELEGANT LUXURY QUALITY These soft, elegant and textured Turkish cotton towels are created with the best quality Turkish cotton available in the world. We harvest our cotton fibers from the cotton fields of the Aegean region in Turkey. We then weave them into a variety of lavish designs, sizes, and shapes. No matter which Enchante Home towel you use, you can be sure of its quality, durability, and softness. We take pride in creating only the best luxury quality textiles that make every day feel like a spa day! UNIQUE & BEAUTIFUL DESIGNS Not only do our Enchante Home towels and textiles offer supreme softness, durability, and absorbency with an extremely fast-drying design, but they are also created in a multitude of different designs, shapes, colors, and patterns. With our wide selection of towels and home textile products, your home will look as beautiful as our soft towels feel! Our towels are truly a treasure you won’t want to miss. AUTHENTIC TURKISH COTTON, SOFT & SAFE grown in the Aegean region, Turkey grown in the Aegean region, Turkey patterns designed and sold in the U.S.A. patterns designed and sold in the U.S.A. machine washable machine washable durable hemming and weave for a comfortable, long-lasting design durable hemming and weave for a comfortable, long-lasting design design that gets softer and softer every time you wash it design that gets softer and softer every time you wash it high-density design to support fast drying and extra absorbent qualities high-density design to support fast drying and extra absorbent qualities","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dlhtxTJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enchante Home","source_asin":"B07RJ18XKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RJ18XKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RJ18XKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
