window.products.push({"id":1034904,"name":"40inch Giant Number 2 Balloon Rose Gold with 12\" Rose Gold Latex Balloons Pack of 10 for 2th Anniversary Birthday Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dfjtwkUJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"➤ Are you feeling great to celebrate a BIRTHDAY OR Anniversary in your life or of your loved ones? Brighten up your big day with this giant Mylar Foil Rose Gold Number Balloon that marks the best years of your being.  ➤This affordable Rose Gold Metallic balloons will create a glimmering party ambiance. It’s an absolute captivating party favors.  Worry no more because this will completely make your party a captivating one. ADD TO YOUR CART and BUY NOW! Then these rose gold foil number balloons is perfect way to make a statement and a great addition to your birthday decorations, anniversary party or any celebrations at your home or office. What will you Get: ❤40inch Rose Gold Number 2 Balloon ( Helium/Air Supported) ❤10Pcs 12inch Rose Gold Latex Balloons  ❤1Pcs 10Meter/32 Foot Balloon String(Random Color) ❤1Pcs Balloon Glue Ddots(20dots) How to inflate the balloon? 1. Find out the inflatable mouth in the middle of the transparent sheet.  2. Insert a straw or a pump into the mouth.  3. Blow the balloon up slowly and gently till 80% full.  4. Pinch its mouth tightly for a while, waiting for self-sealing. How to deflate? 1.Find the valve and insert 20cm straw gently(straw is not include pakage) 2.Inser Straw deeply and press to deflate, put away to use again. 3.Gently press the balloon with your hand until the gas is released 4.Finally,fold and collapse it. Warm Tips: - Shipped balloons is uninflated.  -Balloons can fly up need to fill with helium .(be sure to pay attention to safety when filling helium!) -Do not put the balloons near to the flame, sharp objects or lemon juice, they might burst. -Do not fill too much air into the balloons, 80%-90% is enough, and please be gentle when you inflate them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dfjtwkUJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bchoice","source_asin":"B07GNBFB8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1034904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNBFB8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNBFB8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
